OL,3,ARich nations must cut debt as global
OL,4,Ashocks push up borrowing costs, IMF
OL,5,Achief tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe world's advanced economies
OL,8,Fincluding the UK and US need to cut
OL,9,Fborrowing and reduce debt levels
OL,10,Ffollowing weeks of spiralling
OL,11,Fgovernment interest costs, the head of
OL,12,Fthe International Monetary Fund (IMF)
OL,13,Fhas warned.
OL,15,FIn an exclusive interview, Kristalina
OL,16,FGeorgieva said global economic shocks
OL,17,Fhad been "pushing debt levels up like a
OL,18,Fstaircase not to heaven" but that
OL,19,Fgovernments had taken "no action to
OL,20,Fcontain that service cost".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,110,105,200,300,0,100
