OL,3,ARich nations must cut debt as global
OL,4,Ashocks push up borrowing costs, IMF
OL,5,Achief tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,F"[It's] time to take that action," she
OL,8,Fsaid, adding that "courage" was needed
OL,9,Fby politicians to take the necessary
OL,10,Fsteps.
OL,12,FThe intervention comes as government
OL,13,Fborrowing costs have surged in response
OL,14,Fto wars disrupting the supply of oil,
OL,15,Fwhich has fuelled inflation.
